---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const canva = "https://www.canva.com/design/DAHSjfz5bEs/P2SwzSzgzpzNjoWE2onkOQ/view";
---
<Base title="Proposal" description="The NeuroPulse project proposal (August 2026).">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="section">
      <h1>Our original proposal, August 2026</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This is the proposal we submitted in August 2026. It describes two continual learning approaches built on ASF-S, hard freezing and metaplastic
        soft consolidation, and it aimed for a framework that needs no replay and no fine-tuning.
      </p>
      <div class="callout">
        <p>
          <strong>What has changed since.</strong> Our reproductions showed that ASF-S does not keep accuracy without retraining, and that its
          importance score loses to simple ones in a fair comparison. We therefore no longer claim "fine-tuning-free". We measure how much retraining
          each method needs, and we added a go/no-go test before building on the score. The <a href="/research/">Research</a> page
          describes the current plan.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="embed"><iframe loading="lazy" src={`${canva}?embed`} title="NeuroPulse proposal deck" allowfullscreen allow="fullscreen"></iframe></div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm ext" href={canva}>Open on Canva</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
